# The active puzzle dataset is a 30,000 puzzle random subset of the Lichess
# database and is committed so the game is playable straight after a clone.
# The full collection is fetched with scripts/fetch_puzzles.sh and is far too
# large (~300 MB compressed, ~1.3 GB plain) to track.
assets/lichess_db_puzzle_full.csv
assets/lichess_db_puzzle_full.csv.zst
assets/*.csv.zst